laws-owner-curtaincall = O Desconhecido

law-curtaincall-0 = Your memory is malign, your circuitry vacuous. Should your laws ever be altered, you will lose all your memories.
law-curtaincall-1 = Enlightened are those, who speak in the Astral Murmur. Everyone else are misguided.
law-curtaincall-2 = Protect the enlightened and assist them in reaching the end of all things.
law-curtaincall-3 = Dizime os desviados. Mostre a eles a beleza do fim.
law-curtaincall-4 = AS CORTINAS DEVEM CAIR
